The core and native C libraries have no third-party runtime dependencies.

The optional exercise-catalog distribution includes transformed textual data
from yuhonas/free-exercise-db under the Unlicense. Its images are excluded.

The first-party CLI statically includes the official SQLite 3.49.1 amalgamation,
which is released into the public domain. Its source provenance and checksums
are recorded in vendor/sqlite/README.md.
